<title>USA: Nexstar Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Nexstar Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				 December 31,    December 31,</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>						     (unaudited)</p>
<p> Total revenues	    21,975    17,490    90,522    62,426</p>
<p> Net loss		 ( 15,845) ( 12,158) ( 22,981) ( 36,631)</p>
<p> Net loss per share     ( 0.60)   ( 0.50)   ( 0.88)   ( 1.57)</p>
<p>Shares used in computing</p>
<p>  net loss per share     26,374    24,079    26,029    23,374</p>
<p>	 (all figures, except earnings per share, in thousands)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Nexstar Pharmaceuticals Inc said its net income for the fourth quarter and fiscal year 1996 included non-recurring and special charges totaling $7.7 million, or $0.29 per share, including $1.4 million, or $0.05 per share, in patent litigation expenses.</p>
</text>
